WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:01.116
- Hello, Believe Nation!

00:00:01.116 --> 00:00:01.949
It's Evan.

00:00:01.949 --> 00:00:04.564
My one word is believe,
and I believe in people

00:00:04.564 --> 00:00:06.409
more than they believe in themselves,

00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:09.404
and my sincere hope is
that if you see in yourself

00:00:09.404 --> 00:00:12.788
what I see in you, you'll be
able to change the planet.

00:00:12.788 --> 00:00:14.048
So to help you in your journey,

00:00:14.048 --> 00:00:15.095
today we're going to learn from

00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:17.007
bestselling author Eckhart Tolle

00:00:17.007 --> 00:00:20.508
and my take on his top 10
rules for success, volume two.

00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:22.429
Rule number four is my personal favorite,

00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:25.013
and I'd love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:26.281
Also, as you're watching,

00:00:26.281 --> 00:00:28.087
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:29.653
please leave it down in the comments below

00:00:29.653 --> 00:00:30.576
and put quotes around it

00:00:30.576 --> 00:00:32.790
so other people can be
inspired by it, as well.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.705
And if you leave it within
the first couple hours

00:00:34.705 --> 00:00:35.927
of this video going live,

00:00:35.927 --> 00:00:38.722
you have a chance to win
one of two daily prizes.

00:00:38.722 --> 00:00:41.487
(loud whoosh)

00:00:41.487 --> 00:00:45.154
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.190
- I need my story,

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.707
all the things that I've been
telling myself in my mind

00:00:57.707 --> 00:01:01.247
about myself and other
people and my parents

00:01:01.247 --> 00:01:03.303
and my relatives and my coworkers

00:01:03.303 --> 00:01:06.053
and my ex-wife and my ex-husband,

00:01:07.431 --> 00:01:10.233
and what people did to me

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:14.400
or what I did and shouldn't
have done, failed to do.

00:01:18.575 --> 00:01:20.023
Who am I without that?

00:01:20.023 --> 00:01:21.410
I can't let go of that.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.794
I need to think about this more.

00:01:23.794 --> 00:01:26.627
(audience laughs)

00:01:28.064 --> 00:01:30.723
So it becomes habitual place,

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.556
the habitual place of mental noise

00:01:34.954 --> 00:01:37.919
where you feel, "That's me."

00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:40.252
And so every therapist knows

00:01:41.944 --> 00:01:46.218
that you always reach a
point with your clients,

00:01:46.218 --> 00:01:49.456
patients, whatever, depending
on the school of therapy,

00:01:49.456 --> 00:01:54.019
it depends whatever your
clients, your patients, whatever,

00:01:54.019 --> 00:01:57.447
there comes a point when
you hit that resistance.

00:01:57.447 --> 00:02:02.187
They don't want to be free
of their problems. (laughs)

00:02:02.187 --> 00:02:04.770
And the big challenge is there.

00:02:06.444 --> 00:02:10.277
Is this person going to
overcome that barrier?

00:02:11.329 --> 00:02:13.883
Because that barrier is not just

00:02:13.883 --> 00:02:16.300
becoming free of my problems,

00:02:17.917 --> 00:02:21.250
but also becoming free of a very limited

00:02:23.537 --> 00:02:27.537
and ultimately fictitious
sense of identity, me.

00:02:32.206 --> 00:02:34.873
So that is, what I've described,

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.737
is the next step, one would say,

00:02:40.229 --> 00:02:43.735
in the evolution of human consciousness

00:02:43.735 --> 00:02:46.152
is stepping out of self talk,

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.760
which is the conditioned mind,

00:02:53.391 --> 00:02:57.058
and realizing there is
much more to who I am

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:02.147
than this conditioned content of my mind.

00:03:05.265 --> 00:03:08.515
And that is the beginning of awakening.

00:03:10.463 --> 00:03:14.488
It's not those words, not
that you need to believe that

00:03:14.488 --> 00:03:18.124
there is much more to who I am
than the self talk in my head

00:03:18.124 --> 00:03:21.753
because that is still
self talk in the head.

00:03:21.753 --> 00:03:24.250
I believe there's more to who I am.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.167
(audience laughs)

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.474
And you better believe it, too.

00:03:30.474 --> 00:03:34.223
Analytical thinking itself,
or processing information,

00:03:34.223 --> 00:03:35.556
is not creative.

00:03:36.423 --> 00:03:39.923
So even to find a creative or new solution

00:03:40.782 --> 00:03:44.949
to a problem in your life
requires some creative insight.

00:03:46.472 --> 00:03:47.613
So whether it's a problem

00:03:47.613 --> 00:03:50.174
in your work situation
or your personal life

00:03:50.174 --> 00:03:52.983
or something that you need to build or do

00:03:52.983 --> 00:03:55.739
that you have come to a dead end

00:03:55.739 --> 00:03:58.329
or you want to create something,

00:03:58.329 --> 00:03:59.988
whatever it is, a work of art

00:03:59.988 --> 00:04:03.236
or a new system for the computer,

00:04:03.236 --> 00:04:05.949
I don't know the expression for that,

00:04:05.949 --> 00:04:09.247
you need to go to the place
where creativity arises.

00:04:09.247 --> 00:04:10.497
And every human

00:04:12.745 --> 00:04:15.512
who is creative has some access to that

00:04:15.512 --> 00:04:17.241
even if they don't know it.

00:04:17.241 --> 00:04:20.956
It seems to me there's a
general pattern at work

00:04:20.956 --> 00:04:23.706
that it is inherent in the nature

00:04:24.859 --> 00:04:27.776
of physical existence of life forms

00:04:30.398 --> 00:04:34.389
that challenges are an
essential ingredient

00:04:34.389 --> 00:04:36.306
of their life span here

00:04:37.453 --> 00:04:41.286
and part of the way
through which they evolve.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.101
And when they say, "They evolve,"

00:04:44.101 --> 00:04:48.429
what it means is the one
consciousness evolves,

00:04:48.429 --> 00:04:50.679
awakens into this dimension

00:04:51.772 --> 00:04:55.939
through the different life
forms in different ways.

00:04:56.906 --> 00:05:01.073
And it awakens only because
we are being challenged.

00:05:02.977 --> 00:05:06.060
And that is quite a relief to realize

00:05:09.186 --> 00:05:10.941
to be challenged doesn't mean

00:05:10.941 --> 00:05:14.358
there's something wrong. (laughs)

00:05:14.358 --> 00:05:18.995
There's something wrong with
my life that shouldn't be.

00:05:18.995 --> 00:05:23.023
If you believe or act as if
this shouldn't be happening,

00:05:23.023 --> 00:05:25.756
then you get really unhappy.

00:05:25.756 --> 00:05:28.752
Then the challenges become transformed

00:05:28.752 --> 00:05:31.085
into unhappiness inside you.

00:05:32.246 --> 00:05:34.786
If it's not unhappiness, it's resentment.

00:05:34.786 --> 00:05:38.287
If it's not resentment, it's anger.

00:05:38.287 --> 00:05:40.016
It's self pity.

00:05:40.016 --> 00:05:41.714
It's complaining.

00:05:41.714 --> 00:05:45.031
It's despondency. (laughs)

00:05:45.031 --> 00:05:49.413
The simple reason that
you're misunderstanding

00:05:49.413 --> 00:05:51.413
the very purpose of life

00:05:52.953 --> 00:05:57.244
and expecting something that
your mind has come up with

00:05:57.244 --> 00:05:58.968
should be different.

00:05:58.968 --> 00:06:01.686
Some people are afraid of

00:06:01.686 --> 00:06:04.244
not succeeding in whatever they do

00:06:04.244 --> 00:06:06.327
because they have a self,

00:06:08.195 --> 00:06:09.552
their self image,

00:06:09.552 --> 00:06:13.302
which is derived from
thinking, would suffer.

00:06:14.239 --> 00:06:15.977
If I fail at something,

00:06:15.977 --> 00:06:18.894
then my self image will be injured,

00:06:20.433 --> 00:06:24.600
and therefore I'm not even
going to try. (laughs)

00:06:25.716 --> 00:06:27.977
And again, that's to do with

00:06:27.977 --> 00:06:31.533
deriving your identity from thinking.

00:06:31.533 --> 00:06:35.533
And even the thought, "I
have failed," is a lie.

00:06:36.635 --> 00:06:40.670
"I am a failure," is an even greater lie.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.048
You have not failed.

00:06:42.048 --> 00:06:43.553
You can simply reinterpret and say,

00:06:43.553 --> 00:06:45.539
"I have learned something here.

00:06:45.539 --> 00:06:48.372
"This is not for me," for example.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:53.323
But why believe the lies
that your mind produces?

00:06:57.535 --> 00:07:01.702
As you know, many people live
with a very hostile mind.

00:07:05.987 --> 00:07:08.736
But those people are, their motivation,

00:07:08.736 --> 00:07:11.028
their motivation would
probably be very great,

00:07:11.028 --> 00:07:15.034
I would hope, to get out of their minds.

00:07:15.034 --> 00:07:16.459
But first they need to realize

00:07:16.459 --> 00:07:20.193
that their problems are self
generated, mind generated.

00:07:20.193 --> 00:07:22.421
May be surprised to know that there are

00:07:22.421 --> 00:07:26.170
millions, billions of people on the planet

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.188
who have that same thought pattern,

00:07:28.188 --> 00:07:30.618
"There's something wrong with me."

00:07:30.618 --> 00:07:32.868
It's part of the human ego.

00:07:34.258 --> 00:07:36.669
So you bring in the awareness,

00:07:36.669 --> 00:07:39.336
and that will change everything.

00:07:40.941 --> 00:07:43.024
That's the only true key.

00:07:45.959 --> 00:07:49.292
If you fail, next time the anger arises,

00:07:50.913 --> 00:07:53.947
what happens, you will
become aware immediately

00:07:53.947 --> 00:07:56.929
after the anger has subsided.

00:07:56.929 --> 00:08:00.747
And then, "Oh, there it
was, and I wasn't present."

00:08:00.747 --> 00:08:03.164
And then the moment will come

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.817
when you are there in the first,

00:08:06.817 --> 00:08:11.676
if you can catch the anger
the first moment it comes,

00:08:11.676 --> 00:08:13.553
or if you might even see that

00:08:13.553 --> 00:08:18.214
it could be the result of a
thought that creates the anger,

00:08:18.214 --> 00:08:20.729
and if you can be there
in the first moment

00:08:20.729 --> 00:08:23.729
before it becomes fully blown anger,

00:08:24.682 --> 00:08:26.227
then you can stay there

00:08:26.227 --> 00:08:28.515
and it might not even
become fully blown anger

00:08:28.515 --> 00:08:30.515
if you catch it the first moment.

00:08:30.515 --> 00:08:32.545
You can feel the first stirrings of anger.

00:08:32.545 --> 00:08:36.504
You may only have three seconds,
it may come very quickly.

00:08:36.504 --> 00:08:39.534
Anger is like an explosive energy.

00:08:39.534 --> 00:08:43.534
You may only have two,
three, four, five seconds

00:08:44.453 --> 00:08:46.489
to stay there with your
awareness and feel it,

00:08:46.489 --> 00:08:48.276
"Oh, it's coming, there it is."

00:08:48.276 --> 00:08:52.020
That's the pain body, the
angry pain body, coming.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:56.237
And if you catch it in the
early stage, don't suppress it.

00:08:56.237 --> 00:08:57.737
By catch it I mean

00:08:59.492 --> 00:09:01.721
feel it, be there as a witness.

00:09:01.721 --> 00:09:04.721
Then you can stay, even as it grows,

00:09:06.003 --> 00:09:08.676
the witness grows with it.

00:09:08.676 --> 00:09:10.942
It may not even grow.

00:09:10.942 --> 00:09:12.065
We'll have to see

00:09:12.065 --> 00:09:15.384
whether it still grows into
full blown anger or not,

00:09:15.384 --> 00:09:17.998
but that doesn't matter.

00:09:17.998 --> 00:09:21.440
And so you be thankful for your anger,

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.773
because the anger can become

00:09:24.761 --> 00:09:28.272
a very important spiritual
practice for you,

00:09:28.272 --> 00:09:32.280
because through it, awareness can grow.

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:35.498
So it's sometimes
strange for people to see

00:09:35.498 --> 00:09:39.216
you can be thankful for
things that you think are

00:09:39.216 --> 00:09:42.473
the most difficult obstacles in your life,

00:09:42.473 --> 00:09:46.223
but they can become your
greatest opportunity

00:09:47.617 --> 00:09:49.596
for spiritual awakening.

00:09:49.596 --> 00:09:52.263
Use it as part of your practice.

00:09:53.243 --> 00:09:55.524
There is a source of power in you

00:09:55.524 --> 00:09:57.943
that transcends the person.

00:09:57.943 --> 00:10:01.193
And it's not egoic power over somebody.

00:10:02.508 --> 00:10:05.745
And it's one with the power that is

00:10:05.745 --> 00:10:09.912
the power of life in the
universe where all life arises.

00:10:12.204 --> 00:10:15.537
And people sometimes have a problem with

00:10:17.837 --> 00:10:19.087
self confidence

00:10:20.736 --> 00:10:22.403
or valuing yourself.

00:10:26.483 --> 00:10:28.316
And sometimes, you try

00:10:30.436 --> 00:10:33.753
to convince yourself by
changing your thinking

00:10:33.753 --> 00:10:36.586
that you are actually good enough,

00:10:37.716 --> 00:10:40.482
that you should be self confident.

00:10:40.482 --> 00:10:43.185
But there is a better way

00:10:43.185 --> 00:10:46.352
to find the source of self confidence.

00:10:48.208 --> 00:10:51.062
On the egoic level,
self confidence is there

00:10:51.062 --> 00:10:55.033
because you see you can tell yourself,

00:10:55.033 --> 00:10:58.553
"I'm actually more intelligent
than most of these people."

00:10:58.553 --> 00:10:59.977
(audience laughs)

00:10:59.977 --> 00:11:03.470
Or, "I'm better looking than most.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.885
"I have to remind myself that
I'm better looking than most."

00:11:06.885 --> 00:11:09.752
And then you, "Okay, yeah, I
feel a bit more confident now."

00:11:09.752 --> 00:11:12.500
(audience laughs)

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:16.454
Or you say, "I actually have
more money than these people,

00:11:16.454 --> 00:11:19.204
"so I have more self confidence."

00:11:20.739 --> 00:11:23.739
Whatever it is, some way
of convincing yourself,

00:11:23.739 --> 00:11:26.712
and then you compare yourself with others,

00:11:26.712 --> 00:11:29.919
and then you focus on those areas

00:11:29.919 --> 00:11:32.662
where you feel superior to others

00:11:32.662 --> 00:11:35.040
and try not to think about other areas

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.599
where inevitably you
are inferior to others

00:11:37.599 --> 00:11:40.984
because you cannot be
superior in all areas.

00:11:40.984 --> 00:11:43.324
It's a complicated game when you start,

00:11:43.324 --> 00:11:44.572
(audience laughs)

00:11:44.572 --> 00:11:48.291
start comparing yourself to other people.

00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:50.752
And if you want to bolster
your self confidence,

00:11:50.752 --> 00:11:52.515
then you only have to focus on

00:11:52.515 --> 00:11:55.729
where you feel I'm
actually better than most.

00:11:55.729 --> 00:11:58.979
But that doesn't really work that well.

00:12:00.978 --> 00:12:04.252
So there is a better
way of self confidence

00:12:04.252 --> 00:12:08.737
that has nothing to do with
comparing yourself with others

00:12:08.737 --> 00:12:12.904
or with feeling you're better
than or not as good as.

00:12:15.098 --> 00:12:18.515
And that is direct access to inner power.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.100
You don't need any comparison.

00:12:24.074 --> 00:12:27.824
You can have it right
now at this very moment

00:12:28.882 --> 00:12:32.579
if you're not stuck in your thinking mind.

00:12:32.579 --> 00:12:33.997
But take your attention

00:12:33.997 --> 00:12:37.650
a little bit beyond the thinking mind

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.067
and then realize that you are

00:12:41.806 --> 00:12:44.076
the presence behind the thinking mind

00:12:44.076 --> 00:12:46.940
without which there could be no thinking.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:51.727
You're the aware presence
behind it all that is deeper.

00:12:51.727 --> 00:12:54.607
You've gone deeper than the thinking mind.

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:58.524
And that aware presence
is where power resides.

00:13:03.705 --> 00:13:05.205
And it's not yours

00:13:06.433 --> 00:13:10.041
because it connects you
with universal power.

00:13:10.041 --> 00:13:11.782
Therefore, you don't need to

00:13:11.782 --> 00:13:14.699
compare yourself to anybody anymore

00:13:15.843 --> 00:13:18.510
or feel, as the ego always does,

00:13:20.687 --> 00:13:24.854
that you're either superior
or inferior to somebody else.

00:13:27.574 --> 00:13:30.109
That's not a comfortable way to live,

00:13:30.109 --> 00:13:34.276
where you have to classify
yourself when you meet people.

00:13:35.456 --> 00:13:37.562
(audience laughs)

00:13:37.562 --> 00:13:41.729
And so if the fear is always,
"I might be inferior,"

00:13:43.206 --> 00:13:45.396
(audience laughs)

00:13:45.396 --> 00:13:49.313
or behind that fear is
a desire to be superior.

00:13:53.495 --> 00:13:57.001
(audience laughs)

00:13:57.001 --> 00:13:59.525
What happens when you pay attention

00:13:59.525 --> 00:14:03.358
to the way in which you
interact with objects?

00:14:06.259 --> 00:14:08.759
Okay, every minute of the day,

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:13.015
you pick something up,
you put something down.

00:14:13.015 --> 00:14:15.406
You unbutton your shirt.

00:14:15.406 --> 00:14:17.450
You take off your shoes.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.950
You lift this, put this there.

00:14:20.905 --> 00:14:25.072
Open your zipper bag. (imitates zipper)

00:14:26.002 --> 00:14:27.585
You looking inside.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.187
Take something out.

00:14:31.187 --> 00:14:33.963
Can you feel it as you take it out?

00:14:33.963 --> 00:14:35.639
Can you feel the texture of that?

00:14:35.639 --> 00:14:37.543
And then you put it on the table.

00:14:37.543 --> 00:14:41.063
It makes a sound as you
put it on the table.

00:14:41.063 --> 00:14:42.984
And then you have a glass of water

00:14:42.984 --> 00:14:45.953
and the light is reflected in it.

00:14:45.953 --> 00:14:47.036
And it moves.

00:14:48.266 --> 00:14:50.980
Perhaps you drink, and it tastes.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:53.497
And you put it down again.

00:14:53.497 --> 00:14:55.926
And then you look at a familiar object,

00:14:55.926 --> 00:15:00.512
and instead of using it
always as a means to an end,

00:15:00.512 --> 00:15:03.845
here you have the luxury of occasionally

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:08.615
just taking an ordinary object
that you handle every day

00:15:08.615 --> 00:15:11.695
and just for a few
seconds give it attention

00:15:11.695 --> 00:15:15.528
and acknowledge its being
just as that object.

00:15:16.472 --> 00:15:18.222
Just feel it, see it.

00:15:20.473 --> 00:15:24.140
Hear as it makes a noise
as you put it down.

00:15:25.148 --> 00:15:28.648
And again, you bring in sense perceptions.

00:15:29.997 --> 00:15:34.976
Getting dressed in the
morning, putting your pants on.

00:15:34.976 --> 00:15:38.097
They make a noise as you
put them on a little bit.

00:15:38.097 --> 00:15:38.930
Listen.

00:15:40.539 --> 00:15:41.372
Do things.

00:15:42.281 --> 00:15:44.531
You pick up the toothpaste.

00:15:45.518 --> 00:15:47.741
You hold it for a moment.

00:15:47.741 --> 00:15:48.934
Open.

00:15:48.934 --> 00:15:50.934
Put the cap on the sink.

00:15:53.493 --> 00:15:57.234
And then turn on the tap.
(imitates water running)

00:15:57.234 --> 00:15:59.112
And then while you brush your teeth,

00:15:59.112 --> 00:16:02.713
you turn off the tap, because
you don't want to waste water.

00:16:02.713 --> 00:16:04.530
(audience laughs)

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:06.262
But that's not part of the exercise,

00:16:06.262 --> 00:16:10.429
but it's a natural thing
(audience laughs)

00:16:11.744 --> 00:16:15.661
And you can actually
begin to like and to enjoy

00:16:16.737 --> 00:16:19.154
the tiniest things around you

00:16:20.717 --> 00:16:24.467
that would normally be
completely overlooked.

00:16:25.989 --> 00:16:30.156
So the way in which you interact
with the world of objects,

00:16:33.933 --> 00:16:36.961
that brings a richness into your life

00:16:36.961 --> 00:16:40.259
that doesn't depend on
how many objects you own.

00:16:40.259 --> 00:16:43.783
You don't need to own them
to interact with them.

00:16:43.783 --> 00:16:44.616
So,

00:16:46.689 --> 00:16:49.786
you acknowledge their beingness.

00:16:49.786 --> 00:16:52.281
And sometimes you might
just put your hand,

00:16:52.281 --> 00:16:54.804
as I'm doing now, here's the table.

00:16:54.804 --> 00:16:56.413
It's wood.

00:16:56.413 --> 00:16:58.224
And I'm putting my hand on it.

00:16:58.224 --> 00:16:59.057
And for a moment,

00:16:59.057 --> 00:17:03.057
I feel the smooth texture
surface of this table,

00:17:06.238 --> 00:17:08.488
and it feels very pleasant.

00:17:09.797 --> 00:17:13.435
But I don't need the mind to tell me that.

00:17:13.435 --> 00:17:14.852
I can sense that.

00:17:15.705 --> 00:17:17.788
And the strange thing is,

00:17:18.945 --> 00:17:21.695
even so called inanimate objects,

00:17:23.768 --> 00:17:27.351
in a strange way, have
a life of their own.

00:17:29.013 --> 00:17:30.762
- You know, I'm experiencing anger.

00:17:30.762 --> 00:17:32.959
Of course, you wouldn't say
that, "I'm experiencing anger,"

00:17:32.959 --> 00:17:37.175
but to say, "I am upset," or, "I am sick,"

00:17:37.175 --> 00:17:40.716
is really sort of embedding
that into yourself.

00:17:40.716 --> 00:17:43.220
Where you say, "I'm having an upset,"

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.928
well, if you have something,
you can give it away. (laughs)

00:17:44.928 --> 00:17:45.886
- That's right.

00:17:45.886 --> 00:17:48.611
So it's already progress if from saying,

00:17:48.611 --> 00:17:51.240
"I am angry," or, "I am upset,"

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:55.442
you say, "There is anger in
me," or, "There is upset in me."

00:17:55.442 --> 00:17:57.949
You have already separated
your essential identity

00:17:57.949 --> 00:18:00.767
from the emotional state.

00:18:00.767 --> 00:18:03.240
So you're no longer
reinforcing the emotional state

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:04.790
through your identification.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.019
So that's already--
- Exactly.

00:18:06.019 --> 00:18:07.974
- That's the beginning
of inner transformation,

00:18:07.974 --> 00:18:10.243
is that separation from

00:18:10.243 --> 00:18:13.232
the passing mental or emotional state.

00:18:13.232 --> 00:18:18.164
True self esteem comes from
not identifying with form.

00:18:18.164 --> 00:18:19.350
Now, whether we even want to

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.556
call that self esteem, I don't know.

00:18:21.556 --> 00:18:25.723
The true sense of worthiness
and of power, true power,

00:18:28.464 --> 00:18:32.705
comes when you realize
the formless in yourself,

00:18:32.705 --> 00:18:36.872
that dimension, and that
all power comes from that.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:41.927
But it goes far beyond
the person that you are.

00:18:45.531 --> 00:18:48.222
And then you're rooted in
the formless, so to speak,

00:18:48.222 --> 00:18:49.389
or you are it.

00:18:55.088 --> 00:18:59.682
There's enormous sense
of worthiness in there,

00:18:59.682 --> 00:19:02.518
but it's not comparative.

00:19:02.518 --> 00:19:04.101
It's not more than.

00:19:05.147 --> 00:19:08.293
You see the same worthiness in everybody,

00:19:08.293 --> 00:19:12.248
even if they don't know
it for themselves yet.

00:19:12.248 --> 00:19:15.248
So there's power, but not more than.

00:19:16.763 --> 00:19:19.424
There's just the power of life itself.

00:19:19.424 --> 00:19:22.973
And you know everybody
is an expression of that,

00:19:22.973 --> 00:19:25.207
although they may not know it yet.

00:19:25.207 --> 00:19:26.040
Everybody.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:31.040
So this is, you transcend
conventional self esteem.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:33.734
And it doesn't mean you
lose your sense of worth.

00:19:33.734 --> 00:19:35.938
It shifts into something much deeper.

00:19:35.938 --> 00:19:38.194
If you think the world
is full of evil people,

00:19:38.194 --> 00:19:40.777
you will meet many evil people.

00:19:41.941 --> 00:19:44.204
In other words, unconscious people.

00:19:44.204 --> 00:19:45.897
And even people who are on the brink

00:19:45.897 --> 00:19:48.184
or who are halfway between
conscious and unconscious,

00:19:48.184 --> 00:19:49.564
when you come together with them,

00:19:49.564 --> 00:19:53.490
your belief will pull them
into unconsciousness. (laughs)

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.061
And that's karma.

00:19:55.061 --> 00:19:59.228
So karma is the complete
absence of conscious presence.

00:20:01.287 --> 00:20:03.520
And so it's automatic.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:06.019
It plays itself out.

00:20:06.019 --> 00:20:09.343
And time does not free you of karma.

00:20:09.343 --> 00:20:13.765
That is a misperception, that
if you only spare enough time

00:20:13.765 --> 00:20:16.737
eventually you can become free of karma.

00:20:16.737 --> 00:20:19.987
Karma renews itself and repeats itself.

00:20:20.987 --> 00:20:22.070
It's a wheel.

00:20:23.037 --> 00:20:26.993
And so the only thing
that can free you of karma

00:20:26.993 --> 00:20:29.236
is the arising of presence.

00:20:29.236 --> 00:20:32.569
And how is it that some person presence?

00:20:35.213 --> 00:20:37.299
I cannot tell you why.

00:20:37.299 --> 00:20:41.466
I only know that at any
point in the wheel of karma,

00:20:42.462 --> 00:20:44.212
presence can come in.

00:20:46.151 --> 00:20:50.318
It can happen to a criminal
in prison, condemned to death.

00:20:51.229 --> 00:20:53.512
It can happen to somebody

00:20:53.512 --> 00:20:56.504
who's never heard of anything spiritual.

00:20:56.504 --> 00:20:58.299
It can happen to somebody

00:20:58.299 --> 00:21:01.004
who has been meditating for 30 years

00:21:01.004 --> 00:21:03.216
or not happen to the same person

00:21:03.216 --> 00:21:06.780
who has been meditating
for 30 years. (laughs)

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.613
So,

00:21:09.183 --> 00:21:11.956
in your own life, I can
see from what you're saying

00:21:11.956 --> 00:21:16.412
that presence has
already, I can sense that,

00:21:16.412 --> 00:21:20.286
presence has already come into your life.

00:21:20.286 --> 00:21:23.459
And presence frees you from karma.

00:21:23.459 --> 00:21:24.792
Not all at once.

00:21:25.772 --> 00:21:28.036
Karma has an enormous momentum,

00:21:28.036 --> 00:21:30.786
meaning the patterns in yourself,

00:21:31.743 --> 00:21:34.221
the thought patterns,
the emotional patterns,

00:21:34.221 --> 00:21:35.963
the reactive patterns.

00:21:35.963 --> 00:21:39.217
There's enormous momentum behind that.

00:21:39.217 --> 00:21:41.719
But as presence arises,

00:21:41.719 --> 00:21:44.636
gradually, karma diminishes in its,

00:21:46.722 --> 00:21:49.743
the energy behind it diminishes.

00:21:49.743 --> 00:21:52.160
And gradually, you experience

00:21:53.477 --> 00:21:56.435
a fading out of those patterns.

00:21:56.435 --> 00:21:58.435
They become weaker.

00:21:58.435 --> 00:22:02.964
You're no longer completely
in the grip of those patterns.

00:22:02.964 --> 00:22:04.797
So as presence arises,

00:22:05.688 --> 00:22:08.274
there's a gradual fading out of karma.

00:22:08.274 --> 00:22:11.030
Not that it matters that much anymore,

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.447
because once you are present,

00:22:14.413 --> 00:22:17.830
you can, as the previous question I said,

00:22:20.764 --> 00:22:24.758
when we were talking about
certain thoughts still arising,

00:22:24.758 --> 00:22:27.804
certain negative thoughts,
that's still part of the karma,

00:22:27.804 --> 00:22:31.971
the old patterns, the unconscious
habit patterns inherited.

00:22:33.457 --> 00:22:35.424
They still arise.

00:22:35.424 --> 00:22:38.007
But it's no longer problematic,

00:22:39.031 --> 00:22:41.031
and they no longer cause

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:44.715
the suffering that they
would have caused before,

00:22:44.715 --> 00:22:49.518
because they are seen in
the light of awareness.

00:22:49.518 --> 00:22:51.564
So the light of awareness arises,

00:22:51.564 --> 00:22:53.290
and in the light of awareness,

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:56.335
the patterns no longer dominate your life.

00:22:56.335 --> 00:22:59.069
They no longer run your life.

00:22:59.069 --> 00:23:00.594
And if occasionally it happens

00:23:00.594 --> 00:23:02.559
that the patterns do take over,

00:23:02.559 --> 00:23:04.504
then after a little while,

00:23:04.504 --> 00:23:06.493
your presence returns and you say,

00:23:06.493 --> 00:23:08.942
"Oh, well, there it was again."

00:23:08.942 --> 00:23:11.913
Pain body is part of karma.

00:23:11.913 --> 00:23:13.990
(mumbles may be strong in some people,

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:16.323
not so strong in others.

00:23:16.323 --> 00:23:20.490
And so as presence arises,
you are freed from karma.

00:23:24.466 --> 00:23:26.957
And then you have another
completely different factor

00:23:26.957 --> 00:23:28.790
coming into your life.

00:23:30.473 --> 00:23:32.187
And so, for example,

00:23:32.187 --> 00:23:37.002
for a person to become
free of collective karma,

00:23:37.002 --> 00:23:39.455
you need a considerable amount of presence

00:23:39.455 --> 00:23:41.689
for that to come in to remove,

00:23:41.689 --> 00:23:44.878
and it then will remove
you, in one way or another,

00:23:44.878 --> 00:23:48.229
either internally you find
yourself completely free,

00:23:48.229 --> 00:23:50.916
you might still live in a violent society,

00:23:50.916 --> 00:23:52.814
but internally you will be free.

00:23:52.814 --> 00:23:57.442
There is a possibility you
can have a holy man or woman

00:23:57.442 --> 00:23:59.207
living surrounded by violence.

00:23:59.207 --> 00:24:00.639
It's possible.

00:24:00.639 --> 00:24:03.157
It's rare, but possible.

00:24:03.157 --> 00:24:07.712
Or very often it happens that
life removes you out of there

00:24:07.712 --> 00:24:11.153
and you find yourself somewhere else.

00:24:11.153 --> 00:24:15.320
So, let's say vast,
collective karma, for example,

00:24:18.136 --> 00:24:22.433
in the case of, let's say,
you have the Taliban there,

00:24:22.433 --> 00:24:26.447
you have all kinds of
unconscious movements.

00:24:26.447 --> 00:24:28.995
You had Soviet communism.

00:24:28.995 --> 00:24:31.721
You had national socialism in Germany.

00:24:31.721 --> 00:24:34.804
And for a person being born into that

00:24:36.750 --> 00:24:40.472
and not being drawn into that unconscious

00:24:40.472 --> 00:24:43.055
requires considerable presence.

00:24:44.525 --> 00:24:46.407
So not that many people,

00:24:46.407 --> 00:24:50.781
for example, in Germany
when Hitler came to power,

00:24:50.781 --> 00:24:54.049
not many people were able
to remove themselves.

00:24:54.049 --> 00:24:55.194
Some were.

00:24:55.194 --> 00:24:58.992
Some artists, some writers, they left.

00:24:58.992 --> 00:25:00.751
They could see what was happening

00:25:00.751 --> 00:25:03.696
and they were strong enough

00:25:03.696 --> 00:25:06.475
not to be identified with the collective

00:25:06.475 --> 00:25:08.062
when there had been a tradition

00:25:08.062 --> 00:25:10.846
of obedience to authority
for hundreds of years,

00:25:10.846 --> 00:25:15.502
a tradition of following
your leader, and so on.

00:25:15.502 --> 00:25:18.473
To take yourself out of
that collective karma

00:25:18.473 --> 00:25:22.640
requires considerable presence,
but some people had it.

00:25:23.715 --> 00:25:25.965
So it is our destiny, then,

00:25:27.441 --> 00:25:31.608
to go beyond karma by being
the receptacles for presence.

00:25:35.220 --> 00:25:40.211
All you can do to be helpful
in this world and help others

00:25:40.211 --> 00:25:44.211
is those people that you
come into contact with,

00:25:45.907 --> 00:25:49.490
you may, everybody in
this who is awakening

00:25:50.717 --> 00:25:53.419
will find that sooner or later

00:25:53.419 --> 00:25:56.968
they become a kind of teacher to others.

00:25:56.968 --> 00:25:59.053
And what a spiritual teacher does,

00:25:59.053 --> 00:26:02.571
the teacher points out the
possibility of awakening

00:26:02.571 --> 00:26:06.047
out of identification
with unconscious patterns,

00:26:06.047 --> 00:26:09.770
which means the spiritual
teacher teaches you

00:26:09.770 --> 00:26:11.353
to go beyond karma.

00:26:12.962 --> 00:26:15.656
(whoosh)

00:26:15.656 --> 00:26:17.038
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:26:17.038 --> 00:26:20.756
I made this video because
LiveNow06 asked me to.

00:26:20.756 --> 00:26:22.313
If there's someone
you'd like me to profile

00:26:22.313 --> 00:26:23.580
in a future Top 10,

00:26:23.580 --> 00:26:25.870
please check out the link
down in the description below

00:26:25.870 --> 00:26:29.059
and you can cast your vote
on who we should do next.

00:26:29.059 --> 00:26:30.284
I also want to give a quick shoutout

00:26:30.284 --> 00:26:32.697
to Linh Podetti from Outsourcing Angel.

00:26:32.697 --> 00:26:34.413
Thank you so much, Linh, for picking up

00:26:34.413 --> 00:26:36.234
a copy of my book, Your One Word,

00:26:36.234 --> 00:26:38.968
and going through it and
finding your one word of love,

00:26:38.968 --> 00:26:41.544
and then sharing it with
your newsletter, as well.

00:26:41.544 --> 00:26:43.796
I really, really, really
appreciate the support,

00:26:43.796 --> 00:26:46.451
and I'm so glad that you're
applying the wisdom from it.

00:26:46.451 --> 00:26:47.747
Thank you guys again for watching.

00:26:47.747 --> 00:26:48.972
I believe in you.

00:26:48.972 --> 00:26:50.933
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:26:50.933 --> 00:26:52.980
and whatever your own word is.

00:26:52.980 --> 00:26:54.003
Much love.

00:26:54.003 --> 00:26:55.223
I'll see you soon.

00:26:55.223 --> 00:26:57.723
(loud whoosh)

00:27:01.197 --> 00:27:03.280
To meditate successfully,

00:27:05.682 --> 00:27:09.149
the idea that you're doing a meditation

00:27:09.149 --> 00:27:11.956
can be quite an obstacle.

00:27:11.956 --> 00:27:14.789
(audience laughs)

00:27:19.169 --> 00:27:23.336
So maybe that's the first thing
we can get rid of tonight,

00:27:25.939 --> 00:27:29.189
the preconceptions and the expectations

00:27:31.382 --> 00:27:33.465
that come with that term.

00:27:34.691 --> 00:27:37.983
So why did we call it guided meditation?

00:27:37.983 --> 00:27:40.400
Well, we had to use some word

00:27:41.723 --> 00:27:42.957
to get you here.

00:27:42.957 --> 00:27:45.790
(audience laughs)

00:28:01.924 --> 00:28:05.591
Meditation is usually
something that you do,

00:28:08.171 --> 00:28:10.171
among many other things.

00:28:17.435 --> 00:28:20.025
Doing implies all kinds of things.

00:28:20.025 --> 00:28:21.358
It implies time,

00:28:22.475 --> 00:28:24.725
even future to some extent.

00:28:30.733 --> 00:28:34.680
And yet, true meditation, if
you even want to call it that,

00:28:34.680 --> 00:28:38.013
and it's better not to call it anything,

00:28:40.924 --> 00:28:43.240
is not to do with doing.

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:45.157
It's not a doing.

00:28:45.157 --> 00:28:47.990
It's the realization that you are,

00:28:50.183 --> 00:28:51.016
of being,

00:28:53.246 --> 00:28:55.413
which underlies all doing.

00:28:56.881 --> 00:28:58.964
It's prior to all doing.

00:29:01.498 --> 00:29:04.748
Thoughts, emotions, it's prior to that.

00:29:06.930 --> 00:29:08.847
The simple realization,

00:29:10.460 --> 00:29:13.127
not the realization who you are,

00:29:14.913 --> 00:29:19.080
because there can be so
many perspectives on that,

00:29:20.441 --> 00:29:23.505
not the realization how you fit

00:29:23.505 --> 00:29:25.778
into the totality of the cosmos,

00:29:25.778 --> 00:29:30.378
how that seemingly little
life, fleeting existence

00:29:30.378 --> 00:29:33.657
fits into the totality somewhere,

00:29:33.657 --> 00:29:36.907
not realizing how I fit into the whole.

00:29:39.471 --> 00:29:41.971
It's impossible to comprehend.

00:29:44.657 --> 00:29:47.725
But an alignment with the totality

00:29:47.725 --> 00:29:51.808
without the need to mentally
understand anything,

00:29:54.705 --> 00:29:55.872
a realization,

00:29:58.886 --> 00:30:00.553
a simple realization

00:30:04.170 --> 00:30:05.253
that you are,

00:30:06.956 --> 00:30:07.789
which is

00:30:10.689 --> 00:30:13.189
expressed in the sublime words

00:30:16.402 --> 00:30:17.235
I am.

00:30:24.877 --> 00:30:29.044
And if you've missed
elementary grammar at school,

00:30:32.488 --> 00:30:35.071
you might not realize that I am

00:30:38.225 --> 00:30:42.142
is the first person
singular of the verb to be.

00:30:43.925 --> 00:30:47.162
(audience laughs)

00:30:47.162 --> 00:30:51.329
You think it's two completely
different words. (laughs)

00:30:52.494 --> 00:30:55.327
(audience laughs)

00:31:06.957 --> 00:31:09.374
The realization that you are,

00:31:14.982 --> 00:31:16.315
not as a concept

00:31:21.166 --> 00:31:23.083
but as a deeper sensing

00:31:29.766 --> 00:31:31.849
of the life that you are,

00:31:36.744 --> 00:31:38.744
the aliveness, the life.

00:31:46.473 --> 00:31:48.718
And something helpful to realize that

00:31:48.718 --> 00:31:51.676
is to pretend for one moment

00:31:51.676 --> 00:31:54.676
that there is no past and no future.

00:32:03.229 --> 00:32:06.062
(audience laughs)

00:32:08.960 --> 00:32:13.127
I'm saying pretend so that
everybody is still with me.

00:32:14.187 --> 00:32:15.020
If I said--

00:32:15.020 --> 00:32:17.853
(audience laughs)

00:32:19.749 --> 00:32:23.650
If I said, "There is no past and future,"

00:32:23.650 --> 00:32:26.716
some of you might suddenly start thinking,

00:32:26.716 --> 00:32:30.680
"Just a second, aren't you
going to sign books in an hour?"

00:32:30.680 --> 00:32:33.513
(audience laughs)

00:32:40.956 --> 00:32:42.203
No, hmm.

00:32:42.203 --> 00:32:45.036
(audience laughs)

00:32:46.138 --> 00:32:49.453
And the moment you go into thinking,

00:32:49.453 --> 00:32:50.703
you're off into

00:32:53.447 --> 00:32:54.947
the realm of mind,

00:32:55.817 --> 00:32:57.484
the realm of things,

00:33:00.750 --> 00:33:02.753
objects in consciousness.

00:33:02.753 --> 00:33:06.688
Every thought is an
object in consciousness.

00:33:06.688 --> 00:33:09.855
And every thought has a pulling power.

00:33:11.670 --> 00:33:12.753
So it arises,

00:33:14.894 --> 00:33:17.730
and it pulls your attention in,

00:33:17.730 --> 00:33:18.794
and you start thinking,

00:33:18.794 --> 00:33:21.509
"Okay, but I came here half an hour ago.

00:33:21.509 --> 00:33:23.661
"There must be a past."

00:33:23.661 --> 00:33:26.494
(audience laughs)

00:33:35.645 --> 00:33:37.873
Not realizing, of course,

00:33:37.873 --> 00:33:41.519
when you came here it
was the present moment,

00:33:41.519 --> 00:33:43.558
and when the books are going to be signed,

00:33:43.558 --> 00:33:47.524
it'll be the present moment,
because there is nothing else.

00:33:47.524 --> 00:33:50.210
But no need to believe that.

00:33:50.210 --> 00:33:51.313
Let's pretend--

00:33:51.313 --> 00:33:54.146
(audience laughs)

00:33:55.722 --> 00:33:59.889
Let's pretend for a moment that
there is no past and future.

00:34:00.999 --> 00:34:05.166
Or let's just say past and
future become peripheral

00:34:07.987 --> 00:34:11.237
(mumbles) who you are.

